1795281273,45.0,44.5,null],[1795285048,45.0,45.0,null],[1795288413,45.0,44.5,null],[1795292230,46.0,44.5,null],[1795295865,46.0,44.5,null],[1795299489,47.5,46.5,null],[1795303243,47.0,47.5,null],[1795306765,47.0,47.5,null],[1795310456,47.0,48.5,null],[1795314101,48.5,48.0,null],[1795317696,47.5,48.0,null],[1795321302,47.0,46.5,null]],"n":1,"slug":"netanyahu-out-by-end-of-2026","checked":1795323300,"story":{"written":"2026-11-19","approved":true,"hook":"Israel's coalition clock runs out before this market does. If his rival builds a government by Dec 20, YES wins. If talks stall, Netanyahu stays on as caretaker and NO wins.","yes":[{"t":"His bloc won 53 of 120 seats on Oct 27, short of the 61 needed to govern.","sources":["https://www.ksat.com/news/world/2026/10/30/difficult-negotiations-lie-ahead-in-israel-after-netanyahus-bloc-lost-its-parliamentary-majority/","https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/2/arab-parties-back-eisenkot-whats-the-latest-in-israels-coalition-talks","https://jns.org/news/israel-news/right-wing-bloc-wins-israeli-election-with-53-seats-likud-emerges-as-largest-party"]},{"t":"President Herzog gave rival Gadi Eisenkot the first shot at forming a government, after 67 lawmakers backed him to Netanyahu's 46.","sources":["https://www.ynetnews.com/article/sjygemraml","https://en.royanews.tv/news/75836"]},{"t":"Anti-Netanyahu parties already hold a working majority in the new Knesset.","sources":["https://www.thenationalherald.com/eisenkot-unveils-agenda-to-reverse-netanyahus-policies-as-israels-new-parliament-is-sworn-in/","https://www.jpost.com/israel-election-2026/2026-11-16/live-updates-915009"]},{"t":"Eisenkot, Bennett, Golan and Liberman have all ruled out joining a government with Netanyahu.","sources":["https://www.timesofisrael.com/liveblog_entry/liberman-rejects-unity-government-with-netanyahu-vows-coalition-of-zionist-parties-only/","https://www.ynetnews.com/article/s1ei11wajmx"]}],"yes_note":"Alpha Arcade's \"next Prime Minister\" market has Eisenkot well ahead of Netanyahu.","no":[{"t":"Eisenkot's numbers likely need Arab-led parties' support, which parts of his own camp object to.","sources":["https://alhurra.com/en/54081","https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/2/arab-parties-back-eisenkot-whats-the-latest-in-israels-coalition-talks"]},{"t":"Liberman says he won't back a minority government, even a temporary one, which closes Eisenkot's easiest route.","sources":["https://www.israelnationalnews.com/news/434665","https://www.ynetnews.com/article/voxco4ru6"]},{"t":"Netanyahu doesn't have to win. If he stops Eisenkot, he stays in office as caretaker.","sources":["https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/15/can-netanyahu-and-eisenkot-form-a-unity-government-in-israel","https://www.dailysabah.com/world/mid-east/netanyahu-left-on-shaky-ground-after-losing-election-majority/amp"]},{"t":"If Eisenkot misses Dec 20, the next candidate gets 28 days with no extension, which runs to about Jan 20, 2027, after this market closes.","sources":["https://www.jfeed.com/news-israel/to6nkd","https://www.latintimes.com/gadi-eisenkot-mandate-form-israel-government-601042"]}],"no_note":"Being the next PM and being out by Dec 31 are different bets. The deadline is the whole trade.","clock":[{"d":"Oct 27","t":"Election: no majority","s":"done","sources":["https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/29/israel-election-result-shows-no-overall-majority-as-vote-count-complete","https://jns.org/news/israel-news/right-wing-bloc-wins-israeli-election-with-53-seats-likud-emerges-as-largest-party"]},{"d":"Nov 8","t":"Eisenkot gets the mandate","s":"done","sources":["https://openthemagazine.com/world/israels-herzog-asks-gadi-eisenkot-to-form-government-as-coalition-split-looms","https://www.siasat.com/eisenkot-officially-gets-mandate-to-form-israels-next-govt-3571976/amp/"]},{"d":"Dec 6","t":"His 28 days run out","s":"next","sources":["https://www.latintimes.com/gadi-eisenkot-mandate-form-israel-government-601042","https://www.jfeed.com/news-israel/to6nkd"]},{"d":"Dec 20","t":"Last day with a 14-day extension","s":"next","sources":["https://www.latintimes.com/gadi-eisenkot-mandate-form-israel-government-601042","https://www.jfeed.com/news-israel/to6nkd"]},{"d":"~Jan 20","t":"Next candidate's deadline","s":"after","sources":["https://www.jfeed.com/news-israel/to6nkd","https://en.yenisafak.com/world/herzog-tasks-eisenkot-with-forming-israeli-government-3725326"]}],"pay_yes":"YES pays $1 if Netanyahu announces he'll resign, steps down or is removed as Prime Minister by Dec 31, 2026, 11:59 PM ET. An announcement alone counts, even if he leaves later.","pay_no":"NO pays $1 if he's still Prime Minister (including as caretaker) at that time.","pay_src":"Decided by: official Israeli government statements, backed by credible reporting.","watch":"Watch out: a coalition deal isn't enough. He's out when the new government is sworn in, and that can take days after a deal.","dropped":0}},"pending":null,"next":null,"archive":[],"sites":{"alpha":"Alpha Arcade","polymarket":"Polymarket","kalshi":"Kalshi"},"rule":"Every price shown was read twice and agreed within 3c. Every Both Sides point has 2+ independent sources."}